#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: kalicart-bridge.php
msgid "KaliCart Bridge – Agentic Commerce Catalog, ChatGPT Product Feed & MCP"
msgstr ""
"KaliCart Bridge – Catalogue Agentic Commerce, flux produits ChatGPT et MCP"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: kalicart-bridge.php
msgid "https://bridge.kalicart.com"
msgstr "https://bridge.kalicart.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: kalicart-bridge.php
msgid ""
"Makes your WooCommerce catalog agent-readable: product feed checked against "
"the OpenAI spec, catalog REST API and MCP server, with the optional KaliCart "
"Global connection. No LLM inside the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Rend votre catalogue WooCommerce lisible par les agents : flux produits "
"vérifié selon la spécification OpenAI, API REST du catalogue et serveur MCP, "
"avec la connexion facultative à KaliCart Global. Aucun LLM dans l’extension."

#. Author of the plugin
#: kalicart-bridge.php
msgid "KaliCart"
msgstr "KaliCart"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: kalicart-bridge.php
msgid "https://kalicart.com"
msgstr "https://kalicart.com"

#: admin/admin-page.php:25
msgid "Agent-readable catalog"
msgstr "Catalogue lisible par les agents"

#: admin/admin-page.php:33
msgid "Great choice! Your catalog is going global."
msgstr "Excellent choix ! Votre catalogue devient mondial."

#: admin/admin-page.php:34
msgid "Increase your catalog's visibility"
msgstr "Augmentez la visibilité de votre catalogue"

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag to privacy notice, %2$s: closing link tag
#: admin/admin-page.php:40
#, php-format
msgid ""
"AI assistants can now find your products across the KaliCart global network. "
"Only public catalog data is shared, and you can deactivate it anytime. "
"%1$sSee what is shared%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Les assistants IA peuvent désormais trouver vos produits sur le réseau "
"mondial KaliCart. Seules les données publiques du catalogue sont partagées, "
"et vous pouvez désactiver cette fonction à tout moment. %1$sDécouvrez ce qui "
"est partagé%2$s."

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag to privacy notice, %2$s: closing link tag
#: admin/admin-page.php:47
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Activate the Federated Catalog for free: your products join a global network "
"where AI assistants can find them. It only takes one click, and you can "
"deactivate it anytime. %1$sSee what is shared%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Activez gratuitement le Catalogue fédéré : vos produits rejoignent un réseau "
"mondial où les assistants IA peuvent les trouver. Un seul clic suffit, et "
"vous pouvez le désactiver à tout moment. %1$sDécouvrez ce qui est "
"partagé%2$s."

#. translators: %s: name of the external distribution channel, e.g. "OpenAI / ChatGPT product discovery"
#: admin/admin-page.php:66
#, php-format
msgid "Optional — also authorize the channel: %s"
msgstr "Facultatif : autoriser aussi le canal : %s"

#. translators: 1: consent terms version, 2: opening Privacy Notice link, 3: closing link, 4: opening Global Terms link, 5: closing link
#: admin/admin-page.php:72
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Channel terms: %1$s · %2$sPrivacy Notice%3$s · %4$sKaliCart Global "
"Terms%5$s. Leave unticked to join the Federated Catalog only; you can "
"authorize the channel later below."
msgstr ""
"Conditions du canal : %1$s · %2$sAvis de confidentialité%3$s · "
"%4$sConditions de KaliCart Global%5$s. Laissez la case vide pour rejoindre "
"uniquement le catalogue fédéré ; vous pourrez autoriser le canal plus tard, "
"ci-dessous."

#: admin/admin-page.php:83
msgid "Activate Federated Catalog"
msgstr "Activer le catalogue fédéré"

#: admin/admin-page.php:84
msgid "Revoke consent"
msgstr "Révoquer le consentement"

#: admin/admin-page.php:85
msgid "Use the Federated Catalog banner above to manage consent."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez la bannière Catalogue Fédéré ci-dessus pour gérer le consentement."

#: admin/admin-page.php:95
msgid "Check external visibility"
msgstr "Vérifier la visibilité externe"

#: admin/admin-page.php:102 includes/class-admin.php:225
msgid "Heads up"
msgstr "Attention"

#: admin/admin-page.php:103
msgid ""
"Revoking removes your catalog from KaliCart Global federated search. Agents "
"using the federated index will no longer discover your products there. Your "
"data is parked, not deleted, and restored if you re-activate."
msgstr ""
"La révocation retire votre catalogue de la recherche fédérée de KaliCart "
"Global. Les agents utilisant l'index fédéré ne trouveront plus vos produits "
"à cet endroit. Vos données sont mises de côté, non supprimées, et restaurées "
"si vous réactivez."

#: admin/admin-page.php:105
msgid "Yes, revoke consent"
msgstr "Oui, révoquer le consentement"

#: admin/admin-page.php:106
msgid "Keep my catalog federated"
msgstr "Garder mon catalogue fédéré"

#: admin/admin-page.php:119
msgid "Federated distribution channels"
msgstr "Canaux de distribution fédérée"

#: admin/admin-page.php:120
msgid ""
"These optional authorizations allow KaliCart Global to distribute your "
"public product catalog through a named external system. They are separate "
"from joining the Federated Catalog and from the direct merchant feed "
"configured in the ChatGPT Feed tab."
msgstr ""
"Ces autorisations facultatives permettent à KaliCart Global de distribuer "
"votre catalogue public de produits par l'intermédiaire d'un système externe "
"désigné. Elles sont distinctes de l'adhésion au catalogue fédéré et du flux "
"marchand direct configuré dans l'onglet Flux ChatGPT."

#: admin/admin-page.php:126
msgid ""
"Activate the Federated Catalog above before authorizing this distribution "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"Activez d'abord le catalogue fédéré ci-dessus avant d'autoriser ce canal de "
"distribution."

#. translators: 1: consent terms version, 2: opening Privacy Notice link, 3: closing link, 4: privacy version, 5: opening Global Terms link, 6: closing link, 7: global terms version
#: admin/admin-page.php:138
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Authorization terms: %1$s · %2$sPrivacy Notice%3$s (%4$s) · %5$sKaliCart "
"Global Terms%6$s (%7$s)"
msgstr ""
"Conditions de l'autorisation : %1$s · %2$sAvis de confidentialité%3$s (%4$s) "
"· %5$sConditions de KaliCart Global%6$s (%7$s)"

#: admin/admin-page.php:149
msgid "Authorize this channel"
msgstr "Autoriser ce canal"

#: admin/admin-page.php:157
msgid "Revoke channel authorization"
msgstr "Révoquer l'autorisation du canal"

#: admin/admin-page.php:170
msgid "Authorization details and proof"
msgstr "Détails et preuve de l’autorisation"

#: admin/admin-page.php:171
msgid ""
"Your request has been recorded. Inclusion in the index built for OpenAI is "
"not automatic: products or categories that OpenAI's commerce policies do not "
"allow may keep your store out of that index. Your participation in the "
"Federated Catalog does not change."
msgstr ""
"Votre demande a été enregistrée. L'inclusion dans l'index destiné à OpenAI "
"n'est pas automatique : des produits ou des catégories que les règles "
"commerciales d'OpenAI n'autorisent pas peuvent exclure votre boutique de cet "
"index. Votre participation au catalogue fédéré ne change pas."

#: admin/admin-page.php:173
msgid "Export proof (JSON)"
msgstr "Exporter la preuve (JSON)"

#: admin/admin-page.php:174
msgid "Export proof (CSV)"
msgstr "Exporter la preuve (CSV)"

#: admin/admin-page.php:180
msgid "Confirm channel revocation"
msgstr "Confirmer la révocation du canal"

#: admin/admin-page.php:181
msgid ""
"This stops authorization for this external channel only. Your Federated "
"Catalog participation remains active, and the prior authorization stays in "
"the evidence log."
msgstr ""
"Cela met fin à l'autorisation pour ce canal externe uniquement. Votre "
"participation au catalogue fédéré reste active et l'autorisation antérieure "
"demeure dans le journal des preuves."

#: admin/admin-page.php:183
msgid "Yes, revoke this channel"
msgstr "Oui, révoquer ce canal"

#: admin/admin-page.php:184
msgid "Keep this channel authorized"
msgstr "Conserver l'autorisation de ce canal"

